      "content": "i spent fifteen years working on this project. fifteen years of my life. and i just realized this morning that it doesn't actually matter. none of it does. it's just noise. i feel like i've been building a cathedral out of sand and the tide is finally coming in. i'm just... so tired of pretending there is a point to any of it.",
